.TH delete 1  "delete " 
.SH NAME
delete \- Delete one of your cloud snippets (soft\-delete, 30\-day undo)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBdelete\fR [\fB\-\-registry\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fINAME\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Delete one of your cloud snippets (soft\-delete, 30\-day undo)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-registry\fR \fI<REGISTRY>\fR
Registry base URL (default: `FORGEHUB_REGISTRY` or config)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fINAME\fR>
Snippet name
